# The archive and the feature caches are large and fully derivable. Everything
# needed to rebuild the reports without them is tracked.
data/raw/
data/processed/
data/metadata/report/**/checkpoints/
# One exception: the fold `python -m src.predict` ships with. Without it a fresh clone
# can score the committed predictions but cannot identify a recording. The trees
# rather than the network, because the network is wrong while above 90% confident on
# one prediction in twelve and the trees on one in a thousand.
!data/metadata/report/base_10k/xgboost/checkpoints/fold0.json

